#: ValueSet.description
msgid "Proposal: use-case ValueSet 'Quantitative & convertible' for the analyte hba1c (Quantitative with a concentration property (mass/substance/arbitrary/number/quantity), excluding ratios and fractions. The set whose values can actually be pooled / unit-converted.). Candidate pool = << 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : << 246093002 |Component (attribute)| = 733830002 |Glycated hemoglobin-A1c (substance)| against the LOINC Ontology 2026-03-21. 3 concepts (1 with LOINC). Classification of the pool by Scale type and Property; the rule is stated above."
